# Line endings are part of what this repository is.
#
# The tests read the C and the Markdown as text and match patterns per line --
# `tests/api` splits `docs/llm/controls.md` at `^## ` headings, and a heading
# that arrived as `Desktop\r` is a section nothing can find.  A Windows checkout
# with `core.autocrlf=true` (git for Windows' default) rewrites every text file,
# so the `windows` job in CI would fail on the check for a reason that has
# nothing to do with what it is checking.  `eol=lf` makes the working tree the
# same bytes on every platform; binary files are detected by git's own rules and
# left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
